        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "Karenina... the \"heart\" that can truly destroy this place is deeper inside. Enter my real name at the \"heart chamber,\" and this body's self-destruct program will begin."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 8,
        "ActionId": 8,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "She will always... have the right to pass judgment on me.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "This is my promise to Cordelia. And a promise is... something that doesn't change, no matter what."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "(If becoming a monster will make you sad...)"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "(Mom, I'll try harder...)"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Manann's voice thins with exhaustion. Clinging to a body that was no longer hers has become a weight too heavy to bear."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "I can't become a complete monster. I don't want to... let Cordelia down."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "A lifetime of struggle, and yet it all circles back to the beginning. Neither of them can outrun the fate they were handed at birth."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Her consciousness begins to blur again."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "Karenina... I really, really want... to have a body like yours... I want it so much..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "I want eyes... that can shed tears like a human when I'm sad."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "Eyes where... my sadness can be seen."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
            "If she could have seen my pain... maybe she would have taken me with her."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Manann",
